    <artifactId>mc-agent-runtime-engine</artifactId>
    <name>mc-agent-runtime-engine</name>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>
    <description>
        Runs turns: the runtime API's services on the task queue, with the
        agent loop of mc-agent-loop-core turning inside each turn task. A
        turn is a task, each tool call a child task, a turn a tool hands its
        call to a child of that. Its one foreign dependency is the task queue;
        where sessions are kept, which model answers and how a prompt is
        rendered it is given, through the runtime API's ports. It knows turns, tool
        calls and interruptions and runs the API's hook points; what a
        skill, a sub-agent or a permission is, it does not know.
    </description>

